{"id": "32492", "revid": "2236161", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=32492", "title": "Sherman Oaks", "text": "Sherman Oaks a neighborhood in the San Fernando Valley in the Los Angeles metropolitan area in Southern California. It is known more for its shopping malls than for its places to see.\nGet in.\nSherman Oaks is located at the southeast corner of the intersection of Interstate 405 (San Diego Freeway) and US Route 101 (Ventura Freeway).\nThe closest airport to Sherman Oaks is Bob Hope Airport in Burbank."}
{"id": "32494", "revid": "2325520", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=32494", "title": "Sherpa phrasebook", "text": "Sherpa (\u0f64\u0f62\u0f0b\u0f54\u0f60\u0f72\u0f0b\u0f66\u0f90\u0f51\u0f0b\u0f61\u0f72\u0f42) is the main language of the Solu-Khumbu region of Nepal and also in other districts where the Sherpa people predominate.\nPhrase list.\nNumbers.\n1/2 - p'tya\n0 - guka\n1 - tcha\n2 - zet\n3 - ztum\n4 - jah\n5 - yamge\n6 - cse\n7 - gyahe\n8 - dczvi\n9 - ksnevi\n10 - pati\n11 - pating'tchang\n12 - pating'zetng\n13 - pating'ztumng\n20 - zsholu\n21 - zsholung'tchang\n30 - ztmept\n40 - jept\n50 - yammapt\n60 - csapt\n70 - gyhpat\n80 - dczpat\n90 - ksnevpat\n100 - tchahyatp (hyatp)\n200 - zethyatp\n300 - ztumhyatp\n1000 - tchakhzurah (khzurah)\n2000 - zetkhzurah\n3000 - ztumkhzurah\n10000 - patikhzurah\n20000 - zsholukhzurah\n100000 - hyatpkhzurah\n1 million - tchagmang (gmang)\n1 milliard - tchabbang (bbang)\n1 trillion - tchadrmayng (drmayng)\n1 quadrillion - tchapgephhang (pgephhang)"}
